    74.5 ? dial=c1 outLamp6=on  "[p.35:] Set slide switch 6 RIGHT and turn power on. The system is now operating in the search mode. Light 3 will flash on whenever the system detects an object signal (a connection on the rotary switch dial). [ER-39:] \"Light 6 will flash on whenever . . .\""
    74.5 ? relay2=nc relay3=nc relay4=nc relay5=nc relay6=nc outLamp1=off outLamp2=off outLamp3=off  "[p.35:] While in the search mode, the radar system is a simple signalling system. [p.35:] Set slide switch 6 RIGHT and turn power on. The system is now operating in the search mode. Light 3 will flash on whenever the system detects an object signal (a connection on the rotary switch dial). [ER-39:] \"Light 6 will flash on whenever . . .\""
