  1398.8 ? relay6=no  "[p.36:] Set slide switch 6 LEFT. The system is now operating in the track mode. Notice that the rotary switch oscillates about the object signal. [p.35:] It again sweeps past, reverses and continues in this fashion until given other instructions or until the object signal is out of range."
